WEBVTT

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:30.952
And the minute you say to people,

00:16:30.976 --> 00:16:34.522
"Does being authentic condemn you
to being as you always have been?"

00:16:34.546 --> 00:16:35.717
they get it.

00:16:35.741 --> 00:16:39.254
You know, identity --
it's super multifaceted.

00:16:39.278 --> 00:16:42.269
It's made up of traits, roles,

00:16:42.293 --> 00:16:46.026
emotions, aspirations --
all of these kinds of things.

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:47.796
AG: That's a key lesson here.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:50.045
No one has just one authentic self.

00:16:50.069 --> 00:16:52.116
We have multiple selves.

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:54.806
Think about all the identities
you hold at work.

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:57.056
Your taskmaster self is probably different

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:59.766
from your mentor self,
your presenter self

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.307
and your conference call self.